    "descriptionHtml": "<p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">CB One Ryan is a handcrafted wooden decoy with realistic and highly detailed paint finishes.</p><p style=\"text-align: justify; ; white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">The S-swim action creates a lot of flash to mimic a fleeing baitfish.<br />Floating lure with tail down rest position.</p><p style=\"text-align: justify; ; white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Excellent for tuna and pelagics!</p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p style=\"text-align: justify; ; white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>Length 230 mm</span></p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: justify; ; white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>Gr. 130</span></p></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: start; ; white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">A must for EXOTIC FISHING</p>",
